{"id":2844,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>1月15日，人文社会科学学院2026年教职工联欢会温情启幕，全院教职工齐聚一堂，在欢乐祥和的氛围中辞旧迎新、共话发展，现场暖意融融、欢声笑语不断。</p><p>联欢会伊始，芮燕萍院长致辞，向全体教职工致以新年的美好祝福，字里行间满是关怀与期许。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IozC5PnNnRM4NPnClr2MRC4MRrRL4rQ2U8rfLl7YnmrVUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2okhVnSyPUl-4nmM7U4n7Ul78oR7sLzvaM4WfLRUDn7MFn7QknRA7UlQFLNCDnRNJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz7sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10917&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F8EE1AB3F3DC4DAA481717072A046DC/DFBD8DAF/2F6D9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMNL58MzvZMzG4oC7Q2Ll7sUm98LR7Q8LlliozU8MRQ2nm90gihFp2hmCIa0nShkMSy4L1ybMzUsnmW7n7CaLz9PUmLYL49sUlC8Uzv8M4WFUNLYLmAfLznFoz9ioR-Jv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz7sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10917&e=.png\"></p><p>致辞结束后，精彩节目轮番登场：学院领导的三句半诙谐接地气，学生骨干的舞蹈串烧青春昂扬；《开门红》舞姿喜庆、《红日映珊瑚，马舞新时代》动感十足，外语系老师们带来的诗朗诵《我爱上课》尽显教育热忱；通新粉合唱团的经典曲目则满含温情，勾起共同回忆；解凤灵、张彬彬老师即兴演唱的《莫斯科郊外的晚上》悠扬动人。节目形式丰富、亮点纷呈。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IM4V5RMRffLNQkMC8MRUmWkoRCPozTQknlLbMNLbM4TfU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2n1hkM1yZo7CaU4QfUzrRU8CDLR9PU49in7WRnzvPM7nFnlUsUmLPoRTFLmrkn7CJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz7sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10917&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0FFB688F0C6AA5CCF6081C85DBCE714D/ED7B3189/25BDF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ILNU5ZozVfnm78MCznkM7LDnNLbMRVQRMmUaUln7nlC8LRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysokyZLYyZU4ffUmNYUm-4nzCPnRARMm9YL4-YU8WRLmWFM4GZMzAVLzAFo7QkLz9Jv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz7sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10917&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ioz954oz9bnzvZUCNCboR78ol7PM4fQ7MRU4M77PLR-PU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2okh2LYyZMRM7MNUDUNl4nNn2ozUsnmnVnzr2LzCbM4nFolQRU4v8o7VFMNMkLRvJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aoz7sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10917&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0F8F3843D6D6BE3FDF947F4EE5F16974/9FCC748A/6CB07\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_att